{"version":1,"content":"<p>第63屆金馬獎頒獎典禮昨晚（22日）圓滿落幕，最終由電影《雙囍》和《功夫》各獲3獎成大贏家。</p><p>金馬執委會執行長聞天祥公布評審內幕，整體得獎分布呈現百花齊放、類型多元的態勢，不僅完全沒有「分獎」情況，更沒有任何一部電影拿下超過3個獎項。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.225724+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166203+00:00","content_hash":"1bc780c50c80dbd70a13e6df42d781034d1ada23689c2f5c898904ef81305b58","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}